.TH SDL_GPUIndirectDispatchCommand 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_GPUIndirectDispatchCommand \- A structure specifying the parameters of an indexed dispatch command.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_GPUIndirectDispatchCommand
.BI "{
.BI "    Uint32 groupcount_x;  /**< The number of local workgroups to dispatch in the X dimension. */
.BI "    Uint32 groupcount_y;  /**< The number of local workgroups to dispatch in the Y dimension. */
.BI "    Uint32 groupcount_z;  /**< The number of local workgroups to dispatch in the Z dimension. */
.BI "} SDL_GPUIndirectDispatchCommand;
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_DispatchGPUComputeIndirect (3)
